  "bio": "Lora Maze is a remarkably talented dotwork tattoo artist based in Leighton Buzzard, United Kingdom. Her studios at Gravity Tattoo Shop, Blood of Angels Cambridge, and Golden Fang Tattoo exude an immaculate level of cleanliness that ensures a safe, sterile environment for all her clients. Renowned for her meticulous attention to detail, Lora turns skin into a canvas of intricate patterns and mesmerizing designs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Leighton Buzzard, England, United Kingdom"
